### Design decisions derived from research

| Decision | Research basis | Lingraft choice |
|----------|----------------|-----------------|
| Fixed curriculum per level | Waystage/Threshold use defined lists; NGSL uses 560-word bands | `LevelCurriculum` config table |
| Count lemmas/senses not DB rows | Milton, Nation use lemma/word-family counts | `vocabulary_words` sense rows, ordered by `frequency_rank` |
| Mastered = R ≥ 0.90 | FSRS default desired retention; Nation's 98% needs high stability | `MASTERED_THRESHOLD = 0.90` |
| Unlock L+1 at ~70% level progress | i+1 input: ~70–80% known vocabulary in material | `LEVEL_UNLOCK_THRESHOLD = 0.70` |
| P(new) drops as curriculum fills | SRS review load compounding; comprehensible input | `headroom` formula |
| P(new) = 0 when avg_R low | Below 90% known → comprehension collapse | `R_FLOOR = 0.40` |
| Max ~2 new words/quiz cold start | 10–20 new/day sustainable | `MAX_NEW_PER_QUIZ = 2` |
| Per-language curriculum | Milton: vocabulary requirements differ by language | `LevelCurriculum(language_id, level_id)` |

