## Black holes and risks

| Risk | Why it hurts | Mitigation |
|------|--------------|------------|
| **Static tasks vs runtime assembly** | Old model ties quiz to `tasks` row | `ReviewItem` → exemplar → pre-authored `Exercise`; migrate `tasks` table |
| Same sentence repeated for same word/topic | Context memorization not general learning | `user_exemplar_completions` + rotation before repeat |
| Exhausted uniques → random repeat | User stuck in loop | Prefer new exemplar rows; adjacent level; repeat last resort only |
| **Multi grammar tag per exercise** | Raw future concept | MVP: `primary_grammar_block_id` only; reserve `exercise_grammar_tags` junction for later |
| **Confusing FSRS rating with confidence** | Rating (again/hard/good/easy) is input *to* FSRS on submit; confidence is output `R` | Ratings update the card; all planning reads `R` only |
| **Grammar "every topic" with sparse content** | If A0 has 40 blocks but only 20 have tasks, gate blocks forever | Gate on topics **with at least one exemplar/task** only |
| **Bulk import words without `level_id`** | Current Kaikki imports pass level filter as NULL ([exploration finding]) | Backfill levels or exclude from coverage denominator |
| **FSRS rating vs mastery** | Current code derives rating from speed+correctness, not user judgment ([`quiz.go`](back/internal/handlers/quiz.go)) | Keep auto-rating for MVP; modality uses R not rating |
| **Review avalanche (1000+ due)** | Too many new items or skipped days → user quits | Priority queue + `MAX_DUE_PER_QUIZ`; pause new at `BACKLOG_WARN`; emergency drain at 200 |
| **Review hell (no new words ever)** | Pure "due first" starves curriculum | `MIN_NEW_SLOTS = 1` when backlog healthy |
| **Promotion vs quiz mix** | User at A1 ceiling but still needs A0 reviews | Weak + due items from all levels compete by priority_score |
| **Queue bypass starvation** | Future manual queue could crowd out due reviews | Cap queue at fixed quota; due items fill first |
| **Free recall grading** | Grammar/vocab production needs fuzzy match, not exact string | Plan normalization + acceptable variants table |
| **Coverage denominator drift** | Adding new A0 words later drops everyone's coverage | Version curriculum sets; snapshot denominator at level unlock |

